  A translation of HOL Light's `Multivariate/paths.ml`, in the style of
  HolMultiLib/Convex.lean: pure, the proofs translated by hand, one `let` per
  OCaml `let`, in file order.  The load-time effects (`add_*_invariants`,
  `parse_as_infix`) are at their file positions.  What paths.ml uses from
  earlier files is passed in `PathsDeps`: everything convex.ml already used
